<title>USA: IPO PRICING - New Era prices at $12.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - New Era prices at $12.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	  New Era of Networks Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $12</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $10 - $12</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			2,760,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter		 UBS Securities</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of shares for the planned initial public offering in New Era of Networks Inc were altered to 2.76 million shares from 2.3 million shares previously. On January 22 1997 New Era filed an initial public offering for 3.3 million shares.</p>
